          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tWATER LANE TL 00 SW \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                         6/52                  \t\t\t\tEntrance Barn at -                                      \t\tWater Lane Farm GV                       \t\t\tII Barn, now used as a gatehouse. C16. Timber frame on brick sill dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roofs. A tall 4-bays barn along roadside with gabled projecting porch on E side to courtyard in 2nd bay from S. This bay now forms a covered carriageway giving access to the yard. Jowled posts and clasped purlin roof with straight wind braces and straight braces to tie-beams. Angled queen-post trusses without collars. (Roberts(1975)No.41). Listing NGR: TL0153402520"
    }
  ],
